# Todo System plugin — build after frontend changes

This plugin is a **standalone Vite bundle** registered with FleekDash via `component_url` → **`dist/pages/app.html`**.

```bash
pnpm run build
```

## Run build after editing

- `src/**`
- `pages/**`
- `vite.config.ts`

## After build

Hard-reload FleekDash route `#/app/todo-system/app`.
